		{
			"id": "text-amelihna",
			"creator": "Amelihna",
			"type": "text",
			"why": "We're curious creatures who adore the world and make art about it!",
			"tags": ["plural", "art", "writing", "blogging", "fantasy", "high fantasy"],
			"excerpts": [
				{
					"title": "regarding_my_newly_discovered_alterhumanity",
					"text": "<p>I am aware that elaborating on my nonhuman perception of myself will make others less inclined to take me seriously, to take me at my word. I do not care. I wish to be honest. I wish to make others feel less alone. Therefore what others think of me is irrelevant.</p>"
				}
			],
